# Unblessed: forbidSuspension kept by Reload, Extend, replace-library and restore (#2239); first blessing awaits human review.
# - A Reload without a Suspension Point loads; one with a `wait` is refused.
# - An Extend whose Handler waits is refused.
# - Replacing fmt with a `note` that may suspend is refused as a whole: s
#   can't take it, so u keeps the old fmt too.
# - After a save and restore, a Reload with a `wait` is still refused.

